<title>THAILAND: Kiatnakin Finance Q3 net rises 77 pct.</title>
<headline>Kiatnakin Finance Q3 net rises 77 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for three and nine months ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>					Three months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)	     0.62	   vs	   0.34</p>
<p>    Net		     45.50	   vs	  25.59</p>
<p>					Nine months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)	     2.18	   vs	    1.89</p>
<p>    Net		    164.47	   vs	  141.65</p>
<p>NOTES: Rev figure not stated. Company's full name is Kiatnakin Finance and Securities Plc.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662)-2529950-3</p>
</text>
